WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:29.980
{Intro}

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:42.870
Stop it! Please stop!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.330
Please stop!
I can't get down!

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:59.340
Why... Why is it that only at times
like this, there's no one around?!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.800
Gash!

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.600
Kiyomaro.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.520
Hey!

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.190
Kiyomaro!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.690
Come home before dinner!

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.820
Okay! I will!

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.280
No, no, no!

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.740
Wait, Kiyomaro!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:24.290
{Part A}

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.710
Elite Demon, Eshuros

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.460
Looks like he's getting
used to playing by himself.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.270
N-No way! That's...

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.600
A book that draws out
the power of a demon!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.520
Then, is there a demon nearby?

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.940
Somebody help me!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.990
Hey, little lady, let's not be too rough now.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.370
Shut up. This is the good part...

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:14.920
Monster!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.090
Monster! Monster! It's going
to eat me! Gash is tastier!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.340
At least she's honest.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.640
You can come down now, boy.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.810
Okay.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.560
It's all right now.
You were scared, huh?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.440
Thank you!
You sure are a nice guy!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.860
Aren't you afraid of me?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:41.820
What are you talking
about? You just saved me!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.110
Why should I be afraid?

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.990
You're a good boy.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.290
Take care on the way home.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.040
I'm going now.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.290
Hey, what are you doing
there? Let's go already!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.040
Take care, little boy.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.420
See you later!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.340
Sorry.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.090
Don't make me wait like that.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.430
He's the demon of that book?

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:13.900
But, what's bothering me is that he helped
Gash when he was in trouble.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.610
He doesn't seem to be a bad guy.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.320
Could he be...

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.070
Could he be a demon with a kind heart?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.410
Perhaps we don't need to fight him.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:35.960
Yeah! If he's a good guy,
we should let him be.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:40.210
If we don't start anything,
there should be no problems.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:44.220
So Shinichi, it's been a while since
you've been in this town.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:49.470
A lot of things have changed, but
as I walk down these streets,

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.680
I remember the pain and rage of the past.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.690
Really? In that case...

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.400
let's destroy them, just
like we've done so far.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.110
Completely destroy everything
that bothers you!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.820
You have incredible power
in your hands now.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.910
D-Destroy this town?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.750
What did he mean by saying he remembers
things as he walks down the street?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.670
That demon... used to live in this town?

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.460
Blending in with humans?

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.670
Then, what he meant by
the pain and rage was...

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.090
Pain!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:32.020
Why... Why is Gash biting my butt?

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:34.640
Why didn't you save me?!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.690
W-What do you mean?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.690
When I couldn't come down
from that swing in the park.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.070
I was really...

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.150
Be quiet!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.280
Do you see those two?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:53.910
Oh! That was the nice man who,
unlike you, saved me earlier.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.750
A-Anyways, that big guy...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.790
he seems to be a demon.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.300
W-What? Is that true?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.840
Yes, and he intends to destroy this town.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.760
No way.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:15.100
There must be some kind of mistake,
Kiyomaro. He's a good guy.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.850
He has a kind heart. He helped
me when I was in trouble!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.480
Yeah, I can hardly believe it myself.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.150
That's why I'm trying to find out...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.030
what he's really like.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.630
Empty cans

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.100
It's hurt.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.810
Leave it alone.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.930
That isn't right.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.980
Kiyomaro.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.070
That man is definitely a good person.
There's no question about it.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.820
But, I definitely heard it.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.280
He said he'll destroy
everything in this town.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.910
No...

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.210
So, this is the school
where you were bullied?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.750
Yes, I suffered the most
at this elementary school.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.550
Hey, Shinichi.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.550
Eh?

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:35.140
You don't need to play soccer.
Go buy juice for all of us.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:39.350
Just do what we tell you,

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.270
and we'll let you be one of us.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.860
Oh. All right.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.730
Great! Let's get started.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.490
Art Festival

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.490
Program    Drama

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.490
Hero    Sakuya

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.490
Princess    Seki

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.490
Shinichi, what part do you want to play?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.460
It's pointless to ask him. 
He can't decide for himself.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.580
A monster's role would be perfect for him.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.000
I couldn't tell them that I
hated what they did to me,

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.920
and before I knew it, they were
all calling me a coward.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:18.640
This is where I began living as a coward.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.810
Then, it's decided. Let's
destroy this place first.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.690
B-But it's a big place.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:28.480
What? That's not a problem for us,
there's nothing to fear.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.650
How many times do I have to tell you...

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.610
I'm an elite amongst the demons.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.320
What?!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.910
So, the demon is...

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.450
the child!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:47.540
You're right. Let's destroy this school,
along with the bitter memories.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.460
That's good.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.550
You seem to be able to make
decisions on your own now.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:57.680
You're no longer that bullied little
boy, capable of nothing.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.730
But, let's do this tomorrow morning.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:07.860
I'm not ready to do this now.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.070
Revenge for being bullied...

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.320
Then, we have no choice but to fight...

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.290
Hey, Gash! What are you...

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.290
Don't worry, I won't touch them.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.250
I just want to watch him a little
more before we fight them.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.810
It's not that I don't
understand Gash's feelings.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:55.240
Why does he want revenge in the
first place, and why not today?

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.490
The battle will be tomorrow morning.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.450
Tomorrow is... Saturday.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.870
Saturday...

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.710
On Saturday...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.960
there's no school!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.170
I see!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.470
He's waiting until tomorrow
so that no one will get hurt.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.470
But, then why...

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.220
You seem to be able to make
decisions on your own now.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.900
I see it now! It's him!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.030
{Part B}

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.460
Business Hotel
Mochinoki

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.460
Mama...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.510
Mama...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.430
Shinichi, it's partly your fault
that you're being bullied.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:08.520
If you don't like it, you
have to tell them to stop!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.940
You're being bullied because
you're not doing that.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:16.230
Have a strong will, and start
deciding for yourself.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.280
Be brave!

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.950
If you can do that, you won't
be bullied as much anymore.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.030
Okay...

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:30.210
If you can do that, Mama
will have no regrets.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:36.800
You're a very kind boy,
so become a good adult.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:44.050
Mama, you don't have to worry in
heaven. I'll become a good adult.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.560
Looking at that picture again?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:48.560
Yeah.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.350
Tomorrow's our big day, eh?

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.310
Yeah...

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.730
Bullying is a bad thing,

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:58.320
and any school which allows it to
happen can only be bad as well.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.780
Such a place must be destroyed!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.280
That's why tomorrow I'm going
to destroy the school.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.240
I decided to destroy it on my own.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.750
That's right! That's the spirit.
Your mother will be proud.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:11.750
Yeah.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.580
Good. Now, go to sleep.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.170
I'll go to sleep right
after I feed this swallow.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.890
This will make you use spells.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.860
And you will help me become king!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.070
You...

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.570
You!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.840
Let's do it.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.670
Oh. You're...

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.590
Well, this is surprising.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:09.060
I didn't think there was
a demon in this town.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:10.890
Is that all you have to say?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.730
You bastard! I'll burn your book.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:18.270
Eshuros, do we really
have to fight that boy?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.280
I know him. He's a really good child.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.150
That has nothing to do with it.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:26.030
Do you understand? If I
lose here, I will disappear!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.580
And if I disappear, how are you going
to fulfill your mother's wish?

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.290
Mama...

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.000
I...

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:38.170
I'll become a person you don't have
to worry about in heaven!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.420
That's right, as long as you have the will...

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.050
we won't lose!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.590
I...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.220
I am an elite!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.430
Gurandamu!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.060
How fragile.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:59.150
I don't know what kind of demon you are,
but you're far too weak to beat me!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.940
I don't know what kind of elite you are,

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.570
but you don't seem that strong.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.570
Kiyomaro, let's destroy just the demon!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.530
Yeah!
Zakeru!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.250
What?! He survived my attack!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.000
What?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.920
Gash, run like you're going to attack him!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.010
Which one do I have to attack?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.380
The human with the book!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:33.180
He has no chance of blocking my attacks
while he's separated from his demon!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.390
Do it!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.180
You think I'd let you?
Zakeru!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.690
Defense spell! Quick!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.610
Kureishiru!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.190
Why are they making reckless
attacks like this?!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.200
Shinichi! Spell!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.280
Granbao!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.330
Did we do it?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.000
W-What?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.890
Let's go, Gash.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:20.640
Is he really human? How did he take our attack
and still keep his cool? Why are those two...

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.110
Why are you getting distracted?!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.610
Attack, quickly!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.490
Gurangarugo!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.200
No!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.330
Kureido!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.540
Zakeru!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.960
Go, Gash!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:47.250
Why don't they quit? How
can they be so strong?

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.920
What are you doing, Shinichi?!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.050
Next attack, you dope!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.090
Guransen!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.220
Why am I...

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.720
The second spell...

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.100
Rashirudo!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.360
Why am I so weak?

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.660
When I got this book, I thought
it would make me stronger...

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:17.200
I tried hard to be someone that my mother
wouldn't have to worry about in heaven.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.950
Why? Why am I...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.710
Wake up, you.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:28.710
Do you really think your mother would
be happy if you destroyed the school?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:32.130
But, the school is a bad place.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.800
I-I have to destroy it.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.640
Is that really what you want?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:41.520
Will doing this make you the person your mother
won't have to worry about in heaven?!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.190
Shut up, kid!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:49.980
Shinichi, are you backing away from
what you've decided on again?

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.030
But...

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:55.820
Shut up! Just do what I tell you!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.990
If you do that, your mom will be happy!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.410
B-But...

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.700
No buts!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.000
I'm smarter than you!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.370
Don't you get it?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:09.380
A stupid person like you can't think
of anything useful anyway!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.510
A person like you doesn't
have to think at all!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.230
Shut up, you...

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.190
You bastard!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:33.860
Do you even know what
you're talking about?!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:40.080
I... People like you, who control
and use others' feelings...

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.120
I'll never forgive!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.830
Mama, I understand it all now.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:52.090
These are strong-willed people.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:56.510
Mama, these are the kind of strong
people you were talking about.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:04.770
So, I hope you realize it now.
Throw away that book.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.020
You are fine as you are right now.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:11.150
I like you because you
helped a wounded bird!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:17.200
Thank you, but I'm not
giving you this book!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:25.120
That's good, you're finally getting it!
Then your mother in heaven will...

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.040
Shut up!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.000
You're not Mama.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.010
Stand up!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.970
Face that way!

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:46.890
Yes... people like you, who have strong
wills, and do what they feel is right...

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.230
were what Mama was talking about.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.940
That's why I want to defeat you!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.150
If I defeat you, I... I...

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:03.490
What? The book's shining a
lot brighter than before!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.040
Kiyomaro!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.200
Come, Gash!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.420
I have to become a strong person!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.630
Guranbaison!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.720
Kiyomaro!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.140
Zakeru!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.980
Damn it!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.110
W-We lost?

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.240
Well, finish it, Shinichi!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.870
Thank you.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.710
I'll get rid of this book.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.670
Stop joking, Shinichi! 
You can't throw it away!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.680
No, I'm throwing it away.
You're a bad guy for fooling me.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:08.100
This book holds evil power.
 It must be thrown away.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:12.060
I'm not listening to
your evil words anymore.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.940
I've decided this.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.450
Finally...

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.660
With this, I will finally...

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.950
Finally...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.620
Is this your mother's grave?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.880
Yeah.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.460
Thank you, for everything.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.540
No problem.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.590
I'm sure your mother won't
worry about you anymore.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.970
Uh huh! She should be
watching us peacefully.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:50.890
Shinichi's mom! Your son, Shinichi,
is a very strong person!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.030
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
You are gazing up

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:35.080
{Preview}

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.670
Kiyomaro is somehow
extremely nice today.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:42.210
Gash... look carefully.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.170
Let's eat fish together!

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:45.960
That's not really me! He's a fake!

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:48.090
He's a demon using the power
of a spell to transform!

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:50.220
What? There are two Kiyomaros!

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:52.720
We look completely
different! Open your eyes!

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:55.600
Ah, I knew it from the beginning.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.350
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:58.940
The Invincible Folgore.

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:00.980
Groping breasts? What's that...?

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.060
Groping Breasts

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.060
Parco Folgore

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.980
The Invincible Folgore!
